{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y部分感受描写过满，个别词句有替人物加戏的倾向，例如“对活着的眷恋”“灵魂飘出躯壳”“心愿终于有了着落”，容易让观众把音乐联想误认为人物经历或心理事实。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物心理的关键转折提亮，感受文字缩小并随音乐分时出现，观众可以先抓住人物在想什么，再跟着音乐接收具体感受，信息层次比X清楚。X的完整叙述在解释动机上略胜一筹，尤其是害怕给对方负担、想收回喜欢却又做不到等心理因果，交代得更充分；但Y反复回收水面、船、歌声和尾声回应等线索，使整段情绪发展更连贯，音乐感受也更细腻具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d782819d-687a-4bbc-bf9a-06bd22ae9f89", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T184330675299Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:45:02.086415+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cd344abe8d93a101268f90f76a6aa6d595937b6931ddf09174468a3caec2a1e6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\